---
<Site title="About Lifeline Development Trust | Purpose & Trustees" description="Meet the trustees and explore the charitable purpose, mission and values of Lifeline Development Trust, based in Sorada, Ganjam, Odisha, India." schema={[{'@type':'NGO',name:'Lifeline Development Trust',address:{'@type':'PostalAddress',addressLocality:'Sorada',addressRegion:'Odisha',addressCountry:'IN'}}]}>
<main><section class="page-top"><div class="wrap"><p class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / About Us</p><p class="eyebrow">THE HEART BEHIND LIFELINE</p><h1>Humanity connects us.<br/>Purpose moves us.</h1><p class="lead">LIFELINE DEVELOPMENT TRUST is rooted in Sorada, Ganjam, Odisha, with a shared commitment to dignity, equality and community development.</p></div></section>
<section class="wrap section intro-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">OUR STORY & PURPOSE</p><h2>A local foundation.<br/>A shared future.</h2></div><div><p class="lead">The Trust’s founding purpose is to bring education, medical relief and support for people facing hardship into one charitable framework.</p><p>The supplied trust deed sets out objectives spanning schools and libraries, health awareness, food and shelter, vocational training, social welfare, culture and environmental protection.</p><p>No founding date or verified activity history has been supplied. We therefore describe our purpose and planned objectives without presenting them as completed projects.</p><a class="text-link" href="/programs">Read our charitable objectives ↗</a></div></section>
<section class="aqua-section"><div class="wrap section purpose-grid"><article class="purpose-card"><p class="eyebrow">OUR MISSION</p><h2>Care that creates opportunity.</h2><p>To advance education, promote health awareness and support people facing hardship through inclusive, community-focused charitable work.</p></article><article class="purpose-card vision"><p class="eyebrow">OUR VISION</p><h2>A future with dignity for all.</h2><p>A society where dignity, equality, learning and wellbeing are within everyone’s reach, and communities can shape their own futures.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="wrap section"><p class="eyebrow">WHAT GUIDES US</p><h2>Values we stand for.</h2><div class="value-row">{['Humanity','Equality','Transparency','Education','Community Development'].map(v=><span class="value-chip">{v}</span>)}</div><div class="intro-grid" style="margin-top:40px"><p>We believe that care begins with respect: listening to people, welcoming participation without discrimination and recognizing the dignity of every individual.</p><p>Our commitment to transparency means separating intention from evidence. Verified reports and outcomes belong in the public conversation; unsupported claims do not.</p></div></section>
<section class="aqua-section"><div class="wrap section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">BOARD OF TRUSTEES</p><h2>Guided by responsibility.</h2></div></div><div class="trustees-grid">{trustees.map(([initials,name,role])=><article class="trustee">{name === 'Shri Sibasankar Panda' ? <img src="/uploads/chat-8a50356365ab64842c0210deafdfaf6ecfb2a0c675f723104d3f4f26924ea3ee.webp" alt="Shri Sibasankar Panda, Founder & Executive Member" width="365" height="480" loading="lazy" style="width:100%;max-width:220px;height:auto;border-radius:16px;margin-bottom:20px" /> : <div class="avatar" aria-hidden="true">{initials}</div>}<h3>{name}</h3><p>{role}</p></article>)}</div><p class="disclosure">Trustee roles follow the supplied trust deed. Shri Sibasankar Panda is identified as Founder as confirmed by the organization. No unverified biographies or qualifications are attributed.</p></div></section>
<section class="wrap section prose"><p class="eyebrow">CHARITABLE OBJECTIVES</p><h2>A connected approach to wellbeing.</h2><ul><li>Promote education, schools, libraries and educational institutions.</li><li>Support medical relief and health awareness.</li><li>Provide relief to people facing poverty through food, shelter and vocational training.</li><li>Promote social welfare, cultural activities and environmental protection.</li></ul><div class="note-box">The supplied deed contains unfilled execution and financial details. It is not presented as evidence of completed registration, tax exemption, certification or audited financial performance.</div><a class="button" href="/contact">Start a conversation ↗</a></section></main></Site>